{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function openDatabase(\n   name,\n   version,\n   onUpgrade?,\n   idbFactory?,\nonBlocked?): Promise<IDBDatabase>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:88"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Opens an IndexedDB database with the specified name and version.\nA blocked request stays pending until native success or error. The caller\nowns the returned connection and must close it when no longer needed."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"name","children":[{"type":"text","value":"name"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The name of the database to open"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"version","children":[{"type":"text","value":"version"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The version number of the database schema"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"onupgrade","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onUpgrade?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"db"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"oldVersion"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"newVersion"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"transaction"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional callback that runs during the onupgradeneeded event.\nUse this to create object stores and indexes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"idbfactory","children":[{"type":"text","value":"idbFactory?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBFactory"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional IDBFactory for testing/mocking (defaults to window.indexedDB or globalThis.indexedDB)"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"onblocked","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onBlocked?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"event"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional diagnostic callback for native blocked events. The request stays pending."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBDatabase"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A promise that resolves to the IDBDatabase instance"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const db = await openDatabase('myApp', 1, (db, oldVersion, newVersion, transaction) => {\n  if (oldVersion < 1) {\n    db.createObjectStore('todos', { keyPath: 'id' })\n  }\n})","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"name","text":"name","level":3},{"id":"version","text":"version","level":3},{"id":"onupgrade","text":"onUpgrade?","level":3},{"id":"idbfactory","text":"idbFactory?","level":3},{"id":"onblocked","text":"onBlocked?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction openDatabase(\n   name,\n   version,\n   onUpgrade?,\n   idbFactory?,\nonBlocked?): Promise<IDBDatabase>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:88\n\nOpens an IndexedDB database with the specified name and version.\nA blocked request stays pending until native success or error. The caller\nowns the returned connection and must close it when no longer needed.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### name\n\n`string`\n\nThe name of the database to open\n\n### version\n\n`number`\n\nThe version number of the database schema\n\n### onUpgrade?\n\n(`db`, `oldVersion`, `newVersion`, `transaction`) => `void`\n\nOptional callback that runs during the onupgradeneeded event.\n                   Use this to create object stores and indexes.\n\n### idbFactory?\n\n`IDBFactory`\n\nOptional IDBFactory for testing/mocking (defaults to window.indexedDB or globalThis.indexedDB)\n\n### onBlocked?\n\n(`event`) => `void`\n\nOptional diagnostic callback for native blocked events. The request stays pending.\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`IDBDatabase`\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to the IDBDatabase instance\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst db = await openDatabase('myApp', 1, (db, oldVersion, newVersion, transaction) => {\n  if (oldVersion < 1) {\n    db.createObjectStore('todos', { keyPath: 'id' })\n  }\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: openDatabase\ntitle: openDatabase\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction openDatabase(\n   name,\n   version,\n   onUpgrade?,\n   idbFactory?,\nonBlocked?): Promise<IDBDatabase>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:88\n\nOpens an IndexedDB database with the specified name and version.\nA blocked request stays pending until native success or error. The caller\nowns the returned connection and must close it when no longer needed.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### name\n\n`string`\n\nThe name of the database to open\n\n### version\n\n`number`\n\nThe version number of the database schema\n\n### onUpgrade?\n\n(`db`, `oldVersion`, `newVersion`, `transaction`) => `void`\n\nOptional callback that runs during the onupgradeneeded event.\n                   Use this to create object stores and indexes.\n\n### idbFactory?\n\n`IDBFactory`\n\nOptional IDBFactory for testing/mocking (defaults to window.indexedDB or globalThis.indexedDB)\n\n### onBlocked?\n\n(`event`) => `void`\n\nOptional diagnostic callback for native blocked events. The request stays pending.\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`IDBDatabase`\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to the IDBDatabase instance\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst db = await openDatabase('myApp', 1, (db, oldVersion, newVersion, transaction) => {\n  if (oldVersion < 1) {\n    db.createObjectStore('todos', { keyPath: 'id' })\n  }\n})\n```\n"}
